  "sourceTitle": "Bean Hamburger Soup",
  "sourceText": "Bean Hamburger Soup\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 4, 2009 - 12:05am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup dry beans\n3 qt. water\n1/4 cup rice\n1 pound can tomatoes\n1 or more potatoes\n6 carrots\n1 cup chopped celery\n1 med. onion\n1 pound hamburger\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook 5 minutes, let stand for 1 hour. 2 Brown hamburger and add to the rest of the soup and cook for an hour. You may have to add more water.",
